{
  "bodyHash": "nZEhn20l8jc=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/aerodactyl_banner.png\" width=\"1980\" height=\"660\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Cobblemon 模組官方整合包&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>適用於 NeoForge</em></span></h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2tsCcWbiYgA?si=zAfUCC1MLsPih05i\" width=\"700\" height=\"393\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>Cobblemon 特色功能（截至目前！）：</strong></em></span></h4><ul>\n<li>捕捉寶可夢來擴充你的隊伍，與野生寶可夢戰鬥以獲取經驗，升級解鎖新招式，並讓你的寶可夢進化。有超過 700 種寶可夢可供捕捉！</li>\n<li>戰鬥採用&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokemonshowdown.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Pokémon Showdown！</em></a></span>&nbsp;引擎，提供精準的競技戰鬥機制。</li>\n<li>部分&nbsp;<em>《寶可夢傳說 阿爾宙斯》</em>風格的機制，例如招式重新學習、實體逃跑戰鬥，以及由<em>你</em>&nbsp;決定何時進化寶可夢。</li>\n<li>可在戰鬥中切換自由移動。你可以在寶可夢對戰時建造、挖礦或與怪物戰鬥！</li>\n<li>透過寶可夢圖鑑記錄你遇見和捕捉的寶可夢。圖鑑具備掃描功能，可分析野生寶可夢！</li>\n<li>騎乘你的寶可夢，以時尚的方式探索 Minecraft 世界！</li>\n<li>在多人遊戲中，你可以與朋友交易和對戰。</li>\n<li>使用牧場讓你的寶可夢在任何地方自由漫遊！</li>\n<li>樹果可在野外發現，於農田種植，堆肥獲得增益，並透過雜交突變出新品種。</li>\n<li>將作物和樹果放入釀造台可製作藥品。釀造的藥水治療效果更佳！</li>\n<li>探索世界中的古代結構。部分結構含有鍍金寶箱，可能藏有珍貴戰利品或其他驚喜！</li>\n<li>在特定地點挖掘可疑的礫石或沙土可發現化石，隨後可使用復活機器復活。</li>\n<li>第一至第九世代的所有寶可夢皆可生成並對戰，若尚未有模型則會以替身娃娃顯示。</li>\n<li>完整支援透過資料包和資源包自訂變種與自創寶可夢。你可參考&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252fguides%252fcustompokemon.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">我們的指南</a></span>了解如何操作！</li>\n<li><em><strong>……未來還將有更多內容！</strong></em></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>關於此整合包：</strong></span></h4><p>Cobblemon 整合包旨在透過優化的視覺與音效提升 Minecraft 的沉浸感，並藉由多款優化模組使運行效能優於原版 Cobblemon。同時加入一些生活品質功能，在不大幅改變原版 Minecraft 的前提下改善遊戲體驗。包含選用附加內容，例如推薦的資源包和光影包，預設為停用。</p><p><strong><em>注意：</em>&nbsp;Cobblemon 並無官方伺服器。</strong>&nbsp;你可在我們的&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252fen%252fservers\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a>,</span> 或 Discord 的 #server-listings 頻道找到公開伺服器列表，並將其加入多人遊戲選單。或者，你可向如&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a>.</span> 等主機商購買自己的伺服器。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/bisect_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2172\" height=\"360\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>技術細節：</strong></em></h5><ul>\n<li>整合包與伺服器套件皆可與原版 Cobblemon 伺服器及客戶端連線。</li>\n<li>建議至少分配 2.5 GB 記憶體運行。<em>為達最佳效能，請使用 3 GB 或以上。</em></li>\n<li>此整合包適用於 <strong>NeoForge</strong>，但亦有 Fabric 版本可於&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblemon-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>.</span> 取得。<strong>建議遊玩 Fabric 版本，因其效能更佳。</strong></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></em></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>歡迎來到 Cobbled 農場！</strong></span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/742/408/cobbled-farms-sign.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\"></p><p>歡迎來到 <span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/cobbled-farms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobbled 農場</a></span>，這是一個內建的單人世界，向新手與資深訓練家介紹 Cobblemon 的特色功能！你的任務是協助這個小型農業社區的居民在他們外出時維護美麗的家園。幸運的是，他們留下了書籍，詳細說明維護 Cobbled 農場所需的一切知識，甚至教你如何在自己的世界或伺服器中創建專屬的農業社區！請務必在每個主要更新後查看新版教學世界，以了解 Cobblemon 開發團隊可能新增的任何功能。祝農耕愉快！</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/742/381/cobbled-farms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/728750148007493723/1038387126661824512/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><em><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></em></p><p><em><strong>注意：</strong></em> Cobblemon 模組仍在開發中並持續更新。許多功能尚在製作中或為臨時替代品。部分現有功能也將隨著開發進度進一步完善。未來計劃新增更多功能，包括但不限於 NPC、寶可夢騎乘、繁殖與特殊結構等。</p><p>加入我們的 Discord 以追蹤開發進度、與團隊交流、提問並搶先了解即將推出的功能！<a href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/discord_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"51\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/728750148007493723/1038387126661824512/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>整合包內容</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>此整合包將允許客戶端連線至僅運行 Cobblemon 與 Kotlin for Forge 的伺服器。<br></em></strong><strong><em>若你希望個人使用任何這些模組，請從其原始頁面下載以支持作者。</em></strong></p><h4><strong>模組列表：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-loot-info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階戰利品資訊</a></span>&nbsp;- 用於顯示戰利品表資訊的 EMI 插件。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fambient-environment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">環境氛圍</a></span>&nbsp;- 為生態域色彩添加彩色雜訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蘋果皮膚</a></span> - 顯示更多與食物相關數值的資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbad-wither-no-cookie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">壞凋零沒餅乾 - 重製版</a></span>&nbsp;- 將許多響亮的全伺服器廣播音效改為本地播放。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-advancements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的進度</a></span>&nbsp;- 放大進度頁面並顯示進度資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-ping-display\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的延遲顯示</a></span>&nbsp;- 在玩家列表中顯示每位玩家的延遲數值（毫秒）。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-third-person\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的第三人稱</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許在第三人稱視角中獨立旋轉鏡頭。&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252fc225d60a5d871b3676e2835896a7e0ad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>授權</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcherished-worlds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">珍藏世界</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增書籤和搜尋世界的功能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT 重縫</a></span>&nbsp;- 為資源包添加 MCPatcher 自訂物品材質（CIT）支援。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn-neopatcher\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT重縫新修補器</a></span>&nbsp;- 修補 CIT 重縫，使其能透過 Sinytra 連接器在 NeoForge 上運行。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fclumps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗球聚合</a></span>&nbsp;- 將相近的經驗球聚合成單一實體以減少延遲。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></span>&nbsp;- 將寶可夢加入你的 Minecraft。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcrafting-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成調整</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許使用按鈕旋轉、平衡或清除合成網格。&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252f40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>授權</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcraftpresence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftPresence</a></span>&nbsp;- 在 Discord 上顯示正在遊玩的遊戲資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdefault-options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">預設選項</a></span>&nbsp;- 防止設定檔被更新覆蓋。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdynamiccrosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態準星</a></span>&nbsp;- 根據所觀察的目標改變準星樣式。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></span>&nbsp;- 添加物品與配方檢視器，並與 JEI 整合。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI 附魔</a></span>&nbsp;- 提供基本附魔資訊的 EMI 插件。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI 礦石</a></span>&nbsp;- 顯示礦石在世界中生成資訊的 EMI 插件。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-professions-(emip)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI 職業（EMIP）</a></span>&nbsp;- 添加職業工作站資訊的 EMI 插件。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchantment-descriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔描述</a></span>&nbsp;- 在附魔書的提示框中添加附魔描述。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenhanced-attack-indicator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">增強攻擊指示器</a></span>&nbsp;- 在更多動作上顯示攻擊指示器的進度條。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentityculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體剔除</a></span>&nbsp;- 跳過渲染看不見的實體以提升效能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體模型功能（EMF）</a></span>&nbsp;- 為資源包添加 OptiFine 自訂實體模型（CEM）支援。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體材質功能（ETF）</a></span>&nbsp;- 為資源包添加 OptiFine 實體材質功能（ETF）支援。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffallingleavesforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">落葉</a></span>&nbsp;- 添加落葉粒子效果。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffancymenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FancyMenu</a></span>&nbsp;- 自訂主選單。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fferrite-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore</a></span>&nbsp;- 優化記憶體使用。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmediatelyfast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ImmediatelyFast</a></span>&nbsp;- 優化即時渲染。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finvmove\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">InvMove</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許在開啟物品欄時移動。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finvmovecompats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">InvMove 相容包</a></span>&nbsp;- 為 InvMove 添加 EMI 和 JEI 相容性。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjust-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">恰到好處的效果描述（JEED）</a></span>&nbsp;- 顯示所有狀態效果資訊的 JEI 插件。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">恰到好處的物品</a></span>&nbsp;- 添加物品與配方檢視器。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkrypton-foxified\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KryptonFoxified</a></span>&nbsp;- 優化網路堆疊，<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkrypton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Krypton</a></span> 的 NeoForge 移植版。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flambdynamiclights-unofficial-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LambDynamicLights [非官方 NeoForge 版]</a></span>&nbsp;- 添加動態光源，<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flambdynamiclights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LambDynamicLights</a></span> 的 NeoForge 移植版。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flanguagereloadunofficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LanguageReloadUnofficial</a></span>&nbsp;- 改進語言選擇選單，<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flanguage-reload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Language Reload</a></span> 的 NeoForge 移植版。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flithium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鋰</a></span>&nbsp;- 添加多項遊戲優化。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmonsters-in-the-closet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">衣櫃裡的怪物</a></span>&nbsp;- 高亮顯示任何阻止你睡覺的怪物。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnetherportalfix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄門修復</a></span>&nbsp;- 修復多人遊戲中地獄門連結的錯誤。&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252f40a91e89<h4><strong>依賴項目：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falmanac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Almanac</a></span>&nbsp;- Let Me Despawn 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbalm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm</a></span> - Crafting Tweaks、Default Options 及 NetherPortalFix 所需。<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252f40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>授權許可</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbisect-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting 伺服器整合選單</a></span>&nbsp;- 由我們的託管合作夥伴提供。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbookshelf-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf</a></span>&nbsp;- Enchantment Descriptions 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></span>&nbsp;- 多個模組使用遊戲內設定選單所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fforgified-fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forgified Fabric API</a></span>&nbsp;- CITResewnNeoPatcher 及 Presence Footsteps 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris 光影</a></span>&nbsp;- 所有光影包所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkonkrete\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Konkrete</a></span>&nbsp;- FancyMenu 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkotlin-for-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin for Forge</a></span> - Cobblemon (NeoForge) 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmelody\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Melody</a></span>&nbsp;- FancyMenu 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fopen-loader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Open Loader</a></span>&nbsp;- Tips 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fprickle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prickle</a></span>&nbsp;- Enchantment Descriptions 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconnector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a></span>&nbsp;- CITResewnNeoPatcher 及 Presence Footsteps 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-options-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Options API</a></span> - Sodium Leaf Culling 及 Sodium Extras 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funilib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UniLib</a></span>&nbsp;- CraftPresence 所需。</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>資源包：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Motschen's Better Leaves</a></span>&nbsp;（<em>預設未啟用</em>）- 使樹葉看起來更茂密的資源包。</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>光影包：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders - Reimagined</a></span>&nbsp;（<em>預設未啟用</em>）- 推薦的光影包。</li>\n</ul><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong><em>Cobblemon 與 Pokémon 及 Minecraft 無關聯。</em></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:large\"><em><span style=\"font-size:18px\">M<span style=\"font-size:large\">inecraft 是 Mojang Synergies AB 的商標 ｜ Pokémon 是 Nintendo、Creatures Inc. 及 GAME FREAK inc. 的商標。</span></span></em></span></p>",
